[0.0-5.6] caller: Hello, this is the fraud team at your bank. Someone is using your account right now.
[6.2-8.3] elder: Oh my, what do I do?
[8.9-14.5] caller: We need to move your money to a safe account to protect it while we investigate.
[15.1-17.2] elder: Can I go to my branch?
[17.8-24.1] caller: An employee at your branch was involved, so if the teller asks, tell them it's for home renovations.
[24.7-26.5] elder: I don't know about this.
